                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d935daa0-22e6-360a-970f-2d32f6a94067",
                        "entry_id": "f41206c6-911e-3934-a55e-ac2c05ee279c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a lieu ou qui est en rapport avec quelque chose en dehors d’un territoire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ecd496af-a0ce-415b-9db6-11ec5010f0b6",
                                "sense_id": "d935daa0-22e6-360a-970f-2d32f6a94067",
                                "text": "Il nous venait des impressions étranges : extraterritoriales en un mot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41ee0266-e8b6-4ff9-9e28-60e7f62b2b33",
                                "sense_id": "d935daa0-22e6-360a-970f-2d32f6a94067",
                                "text": "Ils rentrent à l’hôtel comme en un lieu privilégié, quasi extra-territorial, où le luxe et la tranquillité s’achètent, où l’on est l’objet des attentions du concierge et des politesses du directeur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b985856-0e31-4b10-b334-f5ae157a2dd0",
                                "sense_id": "d935daa0-22e6-360a-970f-2d32f6a94067",
                                "text": "En tant que concept politique, l'État-nation se caractérise par une autorité à base territoriale, et non par des conceptions universalistes, extra-territoriales."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ceb605e9-6df7-4080-aad9-1345f77ab548",
                                "sense_id": "d935daa0-22e6-360a-970f-2d32f6a94067",
                                "text": "Concrètement, puisque sont visés des crimes commis à l'étranger, il s'agit de donner aux juges de chaque État des compétences extraterritoriales."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "82f33f81-1f01-35e3-90c2-4437c78a280c",
                        "entry_id": "f41206c6-911e-3934-a55e-ac2c05ee279c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie les activités bancaires et financières domiciliées dans les places étrangères."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "19ad56b7-3675-4ad3-b1a8-a4f3c9f5f2a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "f41206c6-911e-3934-a55e-ac2c05ee279c",
                        "target_lang_word": "extraterritorial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "extraterritorial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e949d52-5586-3a1a-87b1-0e9bc5b3289e",
                                        "entry_id": "869d5507-f7de-3160-b0e9-e3a3aa62f46e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a section of territory: not subject to the laws of the local country."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "402cdec0-9d37-4cce-8616-3fa343b3f026",
                                                "sense_id": "6e949d52-5586-3a1a-87b1-0e9bc5b3289e",
                                                "text": "Panikkar’s study was primarily aimed at providing a survey of Western imperialism in Asia from CE 1498 to 1945. Christian missions came into the picture simply because he found them arrayed always and everywhere alongside Western gunboats, diplomatic pressures, extraterritorial rights and plain gangsterism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af97688c-1732-4c4c-88d4-a4dc4841c4b6",
                                                "sense_id": "6e949d52-5586-3a1a-87b1-0e9bc5b3289e",
                                                "text": "Shepard: Do you know anything about Spectres?\nAvina: The term Spectre is derived from the branch of Special Tactics and Reconnaissance. Each Sepctre agent is hand-picked by the Council.\nAvina: Their primary role is preserving galactic stability and resolving volatile situations that cannot be handled through normal political channels.\nAvina: In this role, they are granted extraterritorial rights and jurisdictions. Spectres answer to no law or authority except the Council itself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d5db7f6b-4a5c-401d-92d1-8ed7d27c0a18",
                        "source_entry_id": "f41206c6-911e-3934-a55e-ac2c05ee279c",
                        "target_lang_word": "offshore",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "offshore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07079ab2-4f85-3ebe-98e5-2e950442c257",
                                        "entry_id": "aebb16cb-e683-31ee-bf60-9977908f87c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moving away from the shore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c090cd94-b20a-330c-b932-0dfbc25c4f05",
                                        "entry_id": "aebb16cb-e683-31ee-bf60-9977908f87c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Located in the sea away from the coast."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03e207c7-7627-458c-a343-e8c5d27d5e54",
                                                "sense_id": "c090cd94-b20a-330c-b932-0dfbc25c4f05",
                                                "text": "an offshore oil rig"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fd2be31-ad0a-42b0-9690-5e5bf8efb3a0",
                                                "sense_id": "c090cd94-b20a-330c-b932-0dfbc25c4f05",
                                                "text": "Since 1949, Taiwan has remained under Nationalist (Kuomintang) control along with the off-shore islands of Chin-men (Kinmen) and Ma-tsu (Lien-chiang County) in Fujian Province. Chin-men and Lien-chiang County are to end their period of direct military rule and to elect their first country magistrates in 1993."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fb6d46d-bb02-4889-b82b-41519842b4b8",
                                                "sense_id": "c090cd94-b20a-330c-b932-0dfbc25c4f05",
                                                "text": "The judges said that the right to a clean environment did not bar the government from drilling for offshore oil, and that Norway did not legally carry the responsibility for emissions stemming from oil it has exported."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7866e38c-810d-30cc-ad12-d3ac409922b9",
                                        "entry_id": "aebb16cb-e683-31ee-bf60-9977908f87c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Located in another country, especially one having beneficial tax laws or labor costs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91125481-d9aa-46af-b2d6-13e6fa2bf922",
                                                "sense_id": "7866e38c-810d-30cc-ad12-d3ac409922b9",
                                                "text": "American companies use offshore services for one reason, said Herbert F. Schantz, a consultant in Sterling, Va.: cheap labor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "607f7a95-6edf-466b-8372-eed80a0c3cce",
                                                "sense_id": "7866e38c-810d-30cc-ad12-d3ac409922b9",
                                                "text": "With pressure building in Europe and the United States for a systemwide crackdown on offshore tax havens the Caymans prefer to call themselves a tax-neutral portal Britain appears determined to make an example of a place that has become a symbol of secrecy and intrigue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfeba070-dd80-44db-82ca-6c0c0a91d8ab",
                                                "sense_id": "7866e38c-810d-30cc-ad12-d3ac409922b9",
                                                "text": "Moving the prisoners is an indispensable step toward closing an extra-legal offshore lockup that has stained this nation’s reputation and become a recruitment tool for terrorists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c2cbe28-6974-42d2-a663-80bf6506ffad",
                                                "sense_id": "7866e38c-810d-30cc-ad12-d3ac409922b9",
                                                "text": "It begins with the anodyne name for the procedures — “offshore processing” — as if these desperate human beings were just an accumulation of data."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "offshore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f624bd02-15bf-3c46-bed9-fd7f7866eb28",
                                        "entry_id": "d85ed66b-0881-3751-a075-5d701212a946",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Away from the shore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78c7a18a-d08f-3557-909c-e88445b14b69",
                                        "entry_id": "d85ed66b-0881-3751-a075-5d701212a946",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At some distance from the shore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "offshore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3630ea45-5f88-3a71-b6a8-01938fa3e4ae",
                                        "entry_id": "a3067b70-b986-3dc0-8fff-3851a52791d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move industrial production from one region to another or from one country to another, in order to seek lower business costs, such as labor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "436c389d-c29e-411d-ab44-1f546fefc2f4",
                                                "sense_id": "3630ea45-5f88-3a71-b6a8-01938fa3e4ae",
                                                "text": "India has become the leading destination for offshored services."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71dcb0d9-3ac0-489d-b27f-bc26c1fbf65d",
                                                "sense_id": "3630ea45-5f88-3a71-b6a8-01938fa3e4ae",
                                                "text": "The McKinsey Global Institute says that 750,000 American service jobs have been “offshored” out of total U.S. jobs of about 140 million."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8962a719-a5f2-453d-906a-701785929799",
                                                "sense_id": "3630ea45-5f88-3a71-b6a8-01938fa3e4ae",
                                                "text": "Corporations offshore their production, because they can more cheaply produce abroad what they sell to Americans. When corporations bring their offshored production to the U.S. to sell, the goods count as imports."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "offshore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bf09d20-371f-3500-a297-ec7213d2cbc6",
                                        "entry_id": "61bb6f25-a3ad-361a-af59-e80e631107dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An area of or portion of sea away from the shore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b740a324-e8fc-4661-a737-fb8c0bc5e7f6",
                                                "sense_id": "8bf09d20-371f-3500-a297-ec7213d2cbc6",
                                                "text": "This problem, so far as the offshores of the United States is concerned, is one that is eminently worthy of the attention of the United States Fish Commission and the support of Congress in its attempt to solve it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5e9f7ee-15ee-3287-8b33-c3190039ae03",
                                        "entry_id": "61bb6f25-a3ad-361a-af59-e80e631107dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An island, outcrop, or other land away from shore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b3f9574-a2d1-4e3e-9568-a41f405e1ef7",
                                                "sense_id": "e5e9f7ee-15ee-3287-8b33-c3190039ae03",
                                                "text": "The Nationalists see that they have nothing to gain—in fact, a lot to lose—by hanging onto the offshores as military bases."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4edcf81-cebf-3e93-b3f5-bbd29dd135d4",
                                        "entry_id": "61bb6f25-a3ad-361a-af59-e80e631107dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something or someone in, from, or associated with another country."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07aa03b1-664b-40a9-bac3-0be3f64c7efb",
                                                "sense_id": "b4edcf81-cebf-3e93-b3f5-bbd29dd135d4",
                                                "text": "If costs are unequally imposed by governments on their offshores, the government makes the U.S. banking industry less competitive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37a8aaac-a796-4b6a-8437-f522c9ccf0f2",
                                                "sense_id": "b4edcf81-cebf-3e93-b3f5-bbd29dd135d4",
                                                "text": "Though American legislators renewed restrictive immigration policies in the two decades after the war, they allowed employers of farmworkers to import some 4.5 million Mexican \"braceros\" and Caribbean \"offshores,\" as the workers were called."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
